27:21.370 --> 27:22.240
Hong Ye!

27:24.160 --> 27:25.750
Cepat berhenti!

27:25.880 --> 27:26.640
Xiao Yao!

27:28.160 --> 27:28.790
Cepat!

27:43.000 --> 27:43.550
Hong Ye!

27:46.880 --> 27:47.790
Hong Ye!

28:00.750 --> 28:02.550
